{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Upon his head.</b> Upon Aaron's head alone, for he is the anointed priest. Now this was before he set the mitre upon his head, for upon the head it is poured alone. And it is written: like the good oil upon the head, running down upon the beard, Aaron's beard (Psalms 133:2)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:38:57.708011366Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}